WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:32.833
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains

2
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:37.666
what result comes from
offering all actions to Him.

3
00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:39.458
He tells us how actions done with

4
00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:42.500
a spirit of renunciation and surrender

5
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.625
free us from the bondage of karma.

6
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:52.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna

7
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:54.250
assures us

8
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:57.375
that by offering all actions to Him,

9
00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:00.500
a person becomes free from the binding

10
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.291
effects of karma.

11
00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:05.291
In material life, every action

12
00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:06.625
produces both positive

13
00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:09.958
and negative results,

14
00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:11.166
which keep a person bound

15
00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:13.916
in the cycle of birth and death.

16
00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:16.333
Even so-called good actions

17
00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:18.708
or punya bind the soul

18
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:20.541
to the material world,

19
00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:23.250
even if they take one to higher realms.

20
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.583
Lord Krishna emphasises

21
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:28.083
that true freedom comes

22
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:31.166
when one acts only for Him, moving beyond

23
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:35.375
both auspicious and inauspicious results.

24
00:01:35.375 --> 00:01:37.791
Sannyasa-yoga is a wonderful

25
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:41.250
combination of renunciation
and connection with the divine.

26
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.250
When a person aligns their mind and heart

27
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.166
with the principle of sannyasa-yoga,

28
00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:49.375
they attain not only mukti, liberation,

29
00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.416
but vimukti, meaning

30
00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:54.166
a special, higher liberation.

31
00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:56.333
This vimukti allows the soul

32
00:01:56.333 --> 00:02:01.916
in Lord Krishna's eternal abode
to serve Him directly,

33
00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:04.708
which is far greater than the temporary

34
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.541
pleasures of heavenly realms.

35
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:10.458
Lord Krishna uses the words 'mam upaishyasi' –

36
00:02:10.458 --> 00:02:14.541
meaning 'you will come to Me' –

37
00:02:14.541 --> 00:02:17.041
to highlight

38
00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:19.250
that the ultimate goal of this path

39
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.958
is His personal companionship.

40
00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:24.416
Unlike the liberation sought by yogis

41
00:02:24.416 --> 00:02:25.916
and jnanis,

42
00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:27.208
which often ends in

43
00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:29.666
formless realisation,

44
00:02:29.666 --> 00:02:32.666
the liberation given by Lord Krishna

45
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:35.208
is filled with love and service,

46
00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:40.208
where the soul in His
presence attains eternal joy.

47
00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:43.375
Thus, this verse inspires seekers

48
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:44.666
not only from material

49
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:47.000
bondage to be freed,

50
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.708
but to embrace a higher purpose –

51
00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:53.000
Lord Krishna's direct service

52
00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.708
to embrace.

53
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:57.333
By offering all actions to Him,

54
00:02:57.333 --> 00:02:59.750
a person even ordinary activities

55
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:03.083
into steps toward spiritual fulfilment

56
00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:07.000
and eternal joy transforms.

57
00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:13.708
Have you ever wondered

58
00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:17.000
why in life's ups and downs your mind

59
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.458
swings like a pendulum?

60
00:03:20.458 --> 00:03:24.000
In life, you usually get

61
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:27.916
caught up in the results of your actions.

62
00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:30.625
Joy when you succeed,

63
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:34.083
sorrow when you fail.

64
00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:37.583
The constant swinging of emotions

65
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:40.291
tires you out.

66
00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:43.125
Like a sailor amid the waves

67
00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:46.291
trying to keep his boat steady,

68
00:03:46.291 --> 00:03:49.500
in the same way 
you too in your life

69
00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.875
keep striving for stability.

70
00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:53.333
But

71
00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:56.458
I invite you to adopt

72
00:03:56.458 --> 00:04:00.291
a different perspective.

73
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:02.333
Fulfil your duties

74
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:06.500
with a spirit of surrender, knowing

75
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.791
that results

76
00:04:07.791 --> 00:04:14.000
are not entirely in your hands.

77
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.458
Just as a flower

78
00:04:15.458 --> 00:04:17.208
spreads its fragrance

79
00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:20.583
without any expectation, in the same way

80
00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:24.958
you too offer your actions to Me.

81
00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:29.166
When you adopt this mindset,

82
00:04:29.166 --> 00:04:32.041
then you will find emotional steadiness.

83
00:04:32.041 --> 00:04:36.625
You will not be shaken by success or failure.

84
00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:40.500
You will understand that your duty

85
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.166
is simply to act with sincerity.

86
00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:47.000
See, a tree gives its fruit,

87
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.375
but when and how the fruit will come,

88
00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:54.166
that is in the hands of nature.

89
00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:55.416
This perspective

90
00:04:55.416 --> 00:04:58.958
not only frees you from unnecessary stress,

91
00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:03.000
but also to a higher spiritual truth

92
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.625
opens your heart.

93
00:05:05.625 --> 00:05:08.583
In this way, even ordinary actions

94
00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:11.750
attain a divine result.

95
00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.250
Over time,

96
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.916
this surrender lifts your mind higher

97
00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:22.458
and brings you closer to eternal peace.

98
00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:28.791
Family life

99
00:05:28.791 --> 00:05:32.083
is a wonderful tapobhumi –

100
00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:33.291
where for spiritual

101
00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:37.250
growth precious opportunities lie hidden.

102
00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.541
Living family life,

103
00:05:39.541 --> 00:05:42.958
it is easy to get lost in routine,

104
00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:47.000
like cooking, cleaning, earning a living,

105
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:50.666
and caring for loved ones.

106
00:05:50.666 --> 00:05:54.500
These tasks keep cycling around,

107
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:58.416
like the seasons that keep coming and going.

108
00:05:58.416 --> 00:06:00.083
But

109
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:06.041
I share a deep secret with you.

110
00:06:06.041 --> 00:06:09.083
Even the simplest tasks,

111
00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:12.666
when offered to Me,

112
00:06:12.666 --> 00:06:16.458
they too above joy and sorrow, success

113
00:06:16.458 --> 00:06:23.000
and failure – the power to
rise above these dualities they hold.

114
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.625
The medicine of surrendered action

115
00:06:25.625 --> 00:06:27.000
from your life

116
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:31.250
removes the disease of attachment.

117
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.625
When you these

118
00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:36.416
daily tasks do with the right feeling –

119
00:06:36.416 --> 00:06:38.875
with love, patience, and the desire

120
00:06:38.875 --> 00:06:42.458
to do something meaningful,

121
00:06:42.458 --> 00:06:46.041
then they are no longer just chores,

122
00:06:46.041 --> 00:06:49.041
but inner peace

123
00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:54.375
and higher toward
understanding they become steps.

124
00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:57.958
They become a sacred path.

125
00:06:57.958 --> 00:07:00.416
This spirit of selfless service

126
00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:05.166
not only family bonds strengthens, but

127
00:07:05.166 --> 00:07:08.541
also connects your mind to a reality

128
00:07:08.541 --> 00:07:13.125
that lies beyond life's ups and downs.

129
00:07:13.125 --> 00:07:17.458
Living this way, every
moment becomes meaningful,

130
00:07:17.458 --> 00:07:21.500
every action becomes sacred,
and every difficulty

131
00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.791
becomes an opportunity to draw closer to Me.

132
00:07:25.791 --> 00:07:29.458
Just as a medicinal spray

133
00:07:29.458 --> 00:07:31.458
all materials

134
00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:35.083
purifies and cleanses,

135
00:07:35.083 --> 00:07:40.041
in the same way devotion all actions

136
00:07:40.041 --> 00:07:42.000
purifies.

137
00:07:46.208 --> 00:07:49.083
A skilled artist

138
00:07:49.083 --> 00:07:53.333
becomes so absorbed in their art

139
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:56.958
that without worrying about the fruit

140
00:07:56.958 --> 00:08:02.208
they bring their work to completion.

141
00:08:02.208 --> 00:08:04.041
This is the essence

142
00:08:04.041 --> 00:08:07.375
of karma-yoga.

143
00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:10.250
In your professional life, usually

144
00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.833
all people chase results –

145
00:08:13.833 --> 00:08:17.958
like deadlines, targets, promotions.

146
00:08:17.958 --> 00:08:22.166
Every day chasing new goals and achievements

147
00:08:22.166 --> 00:08:25.916
tires you out.

148
00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:27.083
But

149
00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:29.500
have you ever considered

150
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.958
that the results of your efforts

151
00:08:31.958 --> 00:08:35.125
are not always in your control?

152
00:08:35.125 --> 00:08:38.875
What is in your control is

153
00:08:38.875 --> 00:08:44.541
your thoughts and motivations.

154
00:08:44.541 --> 00:08:46.708
When you your work

155
00:08:46.708 --> 00:08:50.000
look at with a spiritual perspective,

156
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.166
then the stress of results begins to lessen.

157
00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:57.208
You focus on the purity of your action.

158
00:08:57.208 --> 00:08:59.750
You focus.

159
00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.791
Every task, however small

160
00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:06.416
or large, when done with the right feeling,

161
00:09:06.416 --> 00:09:09.000
becomes meaningful.

162
00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.083
Think about this –

163
00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:15.291
when a teacher gives knowledge to students,

164
00:09:15.291 --> 00:09:18.958
he is not just teaching a curriculum.

165
00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:22.125
He is lighting a path for life.

166
00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:24.125
Think of your work

167
00:09:24.125 --> 00:09:28.000
as an offering to Me.

168
00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.208
When with a spirit of service

169
00:09:30.208 --> 00:09:31.500
your best

170
00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:35.041
effort you put into work, then yourself

171
00:09:35.041 --> 00:09:38.250
to a higher purpose you connect.

172
00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:43.333
Problems feel lighter, and success feels sweeter.

173
00:09:43.333 --> 00:09:47.333
Just as nature remains tirelessly in motion,

174
00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:48.208
in the same way

175
00:09:48.208 --> 00:09:49.375
you too

176
00:09:49.375 --> 00:09:53.541
continue fulfilling your duty continuously.

177
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:56.666
This perspective not only brings peace,

178
00:09:56.666 --> 00:09:59.666
but also gives you the experience

179
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:02.625
that your work is a path of growth –

180
00:10:02.625 --> 00:10:06.416
not just professionally,

181
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:08.750
but spiritually too.

182
00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:12.083
Ultimately, the true karma-yogi is one

183
00:10:12.083 --> 00:10:19.083
who, while acting, remains
free from the bondage of action.

184
00:10:19.083 --> 00:10:19.750
In action

185
00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:24.333
let purity be in the mind, let purity be the goal,

186
00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:28.208
let it be auspicious, let commitment

187
00:10:28.208 --> 00:10:31.166
be to Me, and the thought of the path be to Me

188
00:10:31.166 --> 00:10:35.833
offered – the response is,
you will come to My refuge.

189
00:10:35.833 --> 00:10:38.291
This is certain.
